OL,3,ALibyan cleared after Lockerbie bombing
OL,4,Atrial dies aged 70
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Libyan who was cleared after standing
OL,7,Ftrial over the Lockerbie bombing is
OL,8,Freported to have died aged 70.
OL,10,FAl Amin Khalifah Fhimah was accused of
OL,11,Fmurdering 270 people in the attack on
OL,12,FPan Am Flight 103 in December 1988.
OL,14,FHe was found not guilty but a second
OL,15,FLibyan, Abdulbasset Al Megrahi, was
OL,16,Fconvicted of playing a clear role in
OL,17,Fthe bombing of the American airliner.
OL,19,FA Facebook post by Libyan Airlines
OL,20,Fannounced his death and expressed the
OL,21,Fcompany's condolences to his family.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
